comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-05T10:29:30.622Z",codex-agent,"Companion pm-cli-website-qrxp is read-only. First slice uses one aggregate native Glossary item, strict schemas, exact scoped resolution and checked native CAS. Alias collision and measured corpus are included; bindings, freshness adapters and publication enabling remain later Features."
  "2026-11-05T11:57:11.677Z",codex-agent,"Native output-control compliance remains a release blocker in pm-glossary-yrza. The public host validates native controls before parser overrides, exposes only read-only generic shaping, and applies producer cursors outside handlers. We do not mark writes read-only or bypass that policy. Explicit budget and cursor fallbacks now pass the packed npm/Bun journeys for every command, with multi-page continuations and pre-write tiny-budget refusal. The exact native contract and arbitrary-provider certification remain unapproved."
